# The public half of the key that signs slipdock-runner's releases (W-2542),
# one "ssh-ed25519 AAAA… comment" line below. The binary embeds this file and
# the release job writes it into the installers; with no key line, a build
# refuses every update. The private half is DAEMON_SIGNING_KEY in the
# daemon-release environment: see the manual's Machines page, Releases.
